	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>62</index>
		<row>
			<columnsID>1f3cc455-e49e-4811-a674-589124bec4c3</columnsID>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>56</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>en</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>           All totals through the lines, pages, and in the whole physical inventory register of fixed assets are checked.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>fa</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>همه جمع‌ها در سطرها، صفحات و در کل دفتر ثبت شمارش فیزیکی موجودی دارایی‌های ثابت بررسی شده‌اند.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>           Все подсчеты итогов по строкам, страницам и в целом по инвентаризационной описи основных средств проверены.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>tr</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>           Sabit kıymetler stok sayım listesinin satır, sayfa ve genel toplamlarına ait tüm hesaplamalar kontrol edilmiştir.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>it</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>           All totals through the lines, pages, and in the whole physical inventory register of fixed assets are checked.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>pl</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>           All totals through the lines, pages, and in the whole physical inventory register of fixed assets are checked.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>vi</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>           All totals through the lines, pages, and in the whole physical inventory register of fixed assets are checked.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>63</index>
		<row>
			<columnsID>1f3cc455-e49e-4811-a674-589124bec4c3</columnsID>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>56</f>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>64</index>
