	<rowsItem>
		<index>66</index>
		<row>
			<columnsID>1f3cc455-e49e-4811-a674-589124bec4c3</columnsID>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>82</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>en</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>           All fixed assets named in this physical inventory register from No. [RowNumberInitial] to No. [LineNumberIsFinite] have been checked in kind by the commission in my (our) presence and entered in the physical inventory register, therefore, I do not have complaints against the physical inventory count commission. Fixed assets listed in the physical inventory register are in my (our) safekeeping.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>fa</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>همه دارایی‌های ثابت نام‌برده‌شده در این دفتر ثبت شمارش فیزیکی موجودی از شماره [RowNumberInitial] تا شماره [LineNumberIsFinite] توسط کمیسیون در حضور من (ما) به‌صورت عینی بررسی شده و در دفتر ثبت شمارش فیزیکی موجودی وارد شده‌اند، بنابراین، شکایتی علیه کمیسیون شمارش فیزیکی موجودی ندارم. دارایی‌های ثابت فهرست‌شده در دفتر ثبت شمارش فیزیکی موجودی در امانت من (ما) هستند.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>           Все основные средства, поименованные в настоящей инвентаризационной описи с № [RowNumberInitial] по № [LineNumberIsFinite], комиссией проверены в натуре в моем (нашем) присутствии и внесены в опись, в связи с чем претензий к инвентаризационной комиссии не имею (не имеем). Основные средства, перечисленные в описи, находятся на моем (нашем) ответственном хранении.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>tr</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>           İşbu stok sayım listesinde [RowNumberInitial] no'dan [LineNumberIsFinite] no'ya kadar belirtilen tüm sabit kıymetler, komisyon tarafından benim (bizim) huzurumda fiilen kontrol edilmiş ve listeye eklenmiştir; bu nedenle stok sayım komisyonuna herhangi bir itirazım (itirazımız) bulunmamaktadır. Listede sıralanan sabit kıymetler, tarafıma (tarafımıza) ait sorumlu depoda muhafaza edilmektedir.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>it</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>           All fixed assets named in this physical inventory register from No. [RowNumberInitial] to No. [LineNumberIsFinite] have been checked in kind by the commission in my (our) presence and entered in the physical inventory register, therefore, I do not have complaints against the physical inventory count commission. Fixed assets listed in the physical inventory register are in my (our) safekeeping.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>pl</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>           All fixed assets named in this physical inventory register from No. [RowNumberInitial] to No. [LineNumberIsFinite] have been checked in kind by the commission in my (our) presence and entered in the physical inventory register, therefore, I do not have complaints against the physical inventory count commission. Fixed assets listed in the physical inventory register are in my (our) safekeeping.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>vi</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>           All fixed assets named in this physical inventory register from No. [RowNumberInitial] to No. [LineNumberIsFinite] have been checked in kind by the commission in my (our) presence and entered in the physical inventory register, therefore, I do not have complaints against the physical inventory count commission. Fixed assets listed in the physical inventory register are in my (our) safekeeping.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
